    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Choosing which one",
     "texto": [
      "**Yang mana?** means \"which one?\" or \"which of them?\" depending on context. **Yang** can introduce the feature that identifies someone."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Clothes and colors",
     "texto": [
      "Unlike English, the name of a garment comes before the color: **kaus merah** is literally \"shirt red\", meaning \"red shirt\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
